    - target: {fileID: 3398807130317371631, guid: c2f794a40efcc024f948db8e995f63e6, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: 'After years of hunting old spellbooks and rotten tunnels, you finally
        find it, the trail of the fire worm, the creature whose flames can turn a
        simple lizard into a true wizard.

        But the worm is caged deep below
        by a cruel Komodo Dragon. In every dungeon you enter, you must steal his
        power: find the key, claim the chest, and only then will the path forward
        unlock.'
